    <string name="brightness_help">The cover panel stays on while a dot is pending (Samsung\'s low-power AOD is system-only). Blinking and low brightness keep the cost down.</string>
    <string name="layout_help">Up to 6 dots. Priority apps come first (see Apps); with more than 6 apps waiting the last dot is white and means “more”.</string>
    <string name="shape_circle">Use circle</string>
    <string name="layout_title">When several apps are waiting</string>
    <string name="shape_rules">• PNG with a transparent background — the transparent part is the outside of the shape\n• Draw in white; gray is dimmer. The file is tinted with each app\'s color\n• At most 1024 × 1024 px and 2 MB; a square canvas fits best\n• Stored downscaled to 128 × 128 in the app\'s private storage</string>

